---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About - Reboot Your Computer" description="About Reboot Computer Repairs. Certified technicians fixing computers in Brisbane since 2008.">
  <section style="padding: 4rem 2rem; background: linear-gradient(180deg, #f9fafb 0%, #fff 100%);">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h1 style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 1rem;">About Reboot Computer Repairs</h1>
      <p style="text-align: center; font-size: 1.125rem; color: #6b7280; max-width: 700px; margin: 0 auto;">
        Expert computer repairs for Brisbane. We've fixed computers here since 2008.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section style="padding: 4rem 2rem;">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div style="max-width: 900px; margin: 0 auto;">

        <div style="margin-bottom: 4rem;">
          <h2 style="color: #DC2626; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">Who We Are</h2>
          <p style="font-size: 1.0625rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #374151;">
            Reboot Computer Repairs has fixed computers in Brisbane since 2008. We're a small team of certified technicians, and between us we've seen most of what a PC or laptop can throw at you. We don't make excuses. We don't keep you waiting.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-bottom: 4rem;">
          <h2 style="color: #DC2626; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">What We Fix</h2>
          <p style="font-size: 1.0625rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #374151;">
            Most computer problems are predictable. Virus infections. Hard drive failures. Battery wear. Overheating. We diagnose fast, explain what's wrong in plain English, and quote a fair price. If you approve, we fix it. If you don't, you leave with no obligation.
          </p>
          <p style="font-size: 1.0625rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #374151; margin-top: 1rem;">
            Here's what we handle most often. Each one links through to more detail on our <a href="/services/">services page</a>.
          </p>
          <ul style="margin: 1.5rem 0; padding-left: 1.5rem; color: #374151;">
            <li style="margin-bottom: 0.75rem;"><a href="/services/#virus-removal">Virus and malware removal</a></li>
            <li style="margin-bottom: 0.75rem;"><a href="/services/#data-recovery">Data recovery</a> from failed and dead drives</li>
            <li style="margin-bottom: 0.75rem;"><a href="/services/#hardware-repair">Hardware repair</a> for screens, batteries and ports</li>
            <li style="margin-bottom: 0.75rem;"><a href="/services/#setup">New computer setup</a> and data migration</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-bottom: 4rem;">
          <h2 style="color: #DC2626; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">Why We're Different</h2>
          <ul style="margin: 1.5rem 0; padding-left: 1.5rem; color: #374151;">
            <li style="margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">No call out fees. You only pay for what we fix.</li>
            <li style="margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">Open 7 AM to 10 PM every day, holidays included.</li>
            <li style="margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">Most repairs done within the hour.</li>
            <li style="margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">No fix, no fee. If we can't fix it, you don't pay.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-bottom: 4rem;">
          <h2 style="color: #DC2626; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">Pricing</h2>
          <p style="font-size: 1.0625rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #374151;">
            Workshop repairs are $150 an hour. On site, it's $150 for the first hour, then $37.50 every 15 minutes. Remote service is $37.50 per 15 minutes. No hidden charges on any of it.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-bottom: 4rem;">
          <h2 style="color: #DC2626; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">Where We Work</h2>
          <p style="font-size: 1.0625rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #374151;">
            We cover the Greater Brisbane area, including Logan, Ipswich, Moreton Bay and Redland Bay. We don't have technicians on the Sunshine Coast at the moment.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div style="margin-bottom: 4rem;">
          <h2 style="color: #DC2626; margin-bottom: 1.5rem;">As Seen On Channel 9</h2>
          <p style="font-size: 1.0625rem; line-height: 1.8; color: #374151;">
            Channel 9 interviewed us about slow internet speeds around Brisbane.
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta-banner">
    <div class="wrap">
      <h2>Ready to Get Your Computer Fixed?</h2>
      <p>Tell us what's going wrong and we'll come back with a price to fix it.</p>
      <a href="/contact/" class="btn btn-secondary" style="color: var(--color-white); border-color: var(--color-white);">Contact Us</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
